# Planetarium of Wan Shi Tong's trigger is independent of its source once it has triggered (CR 113.7a): destroyed in
# response, the ability still resolves, and Bot1 still looks and casts. Bot1 puts the Planetarium out on turn 1 (Sol
# Ring, Black Lotus, Mox Jet). On turn 3 Bot1 activates it with Mox Pearl and scries 2, keeping Misshapen Fiend on top
# and Counterspell on the bottom; with the trigger on the stack Bot2 casts Disenchant on the Planetarium. The Planetarium
# is in the graveyard when its ability resolves, and Bot1 casts the Fiend free all the same.

